[size=5][b]Character Creator UI Improvements[/b][/size]
[i]Browse hairstyles, noses, tattoos, piercings and more in a grid, with favorites, instead of clicking through them one by one.[/i]

With a few hundred CCXL hairs, tattoos and piercings installed, the vanilla selectors mean clicking ◁ ▷ dozens of times to find the one you want. This mod gives those rows the same [b]◁ ▦ ▷[/b] layout as Skin Tone and Hair Color. Click the middle button to open a paged grid of every option.

[size=4][b]Rows with a grid[/b][/size]
Hairstyle, mouth, nose, jaw, ears, cyberware, facial tattoos, piercings and eye makeup.

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Grid picker[/b]: 27 entries per page, with the vanilla UI's red look. Click a tile to apply it right away; the grid stays open so you can keep comparing.
[*][b]Every option[/b]: vanilla and modded (CCXL / ArchiveXL). Each tile shows the name plus the internal option name, so entries that share a display name are easy to tell apart.
[*][b]Favorites[/b]: click the star on a tile to pin it to the front of that category. Favorites are shared across all saves and are stored by name, so adding or removing mods doesn't mix them up.
[*][b]Current option highlighted[/b], and the grid opens on the page that contains it.
[*][b]Minimize rows[/b] you never change (voice tone, teeth, ...): the [–] button collapses a row to a single line with its name and value, and [+] brings it back. Remembered across saves.
[*]Works in the [b]New Game character creator[/b], at [b]mirrors[/b] and at [b]ripperdocs[/b].
[*]The vanilla ◁ ▷ arrows keep working as before.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/1511]redscript[/url]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/7780]Codeware[/url] 1.19.0 or newer
[/list]
Tested on game version 2.31 with redscript 0.5.31 and Codeware 1.19.0.

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
Install with Vortex or Mod Organizer 2, or extract the archive into your Cyberpunk 2077 folder. You should end up with:
[code]Cyberpunk 2077/r6/scripts/CPUIImprovements/CharacterCreator/*.reds[/code]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Delete [font=Courier New]r6/scripts/CPUIImprovements/CharacterCreator[/font]. Saves don't depend on this mod: it only changes the menu, and applies options through the same game function the arrows use.

[size=4][b]Known limitations[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Mouse only. The grid can't be navigated with a gamepad yet; the vanilla arrows still work on gamepad.
[*]Tiles show names, not thumbnails.
[*]English UI text only.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Hooks only the appearance menu of the character creator ([font=Courier New]characterCreationBodyMorphMenu[/font]) and its selector rows, using wrapMethod only. No replaceMethod.
[*]Used in-game with Character Customization Anywhere and CCXL multicolored hair. Compiles together with Fresh Start. Appearance Change Unlocker hooks different methods of the same menu, so there's no overlap.
[/list]

[size=4][b]License[/b][/size]
MIT. You're free to reuse or modify the scripts with attribution.

[size=4][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
The mod writes one line on startup, [font=Courier New][CCUIImprovements] Character Creator UI Improvements 1.0.0 ready[/font], to [font=Courier New]bin/x64/plugins/cyber_engine_tweaks/gamelog.log[/font] (Cyber Engine Tweaks). If the ▦ buttons don't appear, check that line and [font=Courier New]r6/logs/redscript_rCURRENT.log[/font] for errors, and include both in your bug report.
